The article interweaves Trump’s claims with the denials from the former presidents’ representatives, noting that no recent contact has been confirmed. It also includes Trump’s broader political commentary, such as his labeling of Biden as the “worst president” and his assertion that he was the only president who acted against Iran. The piece presents these statements without further verification or independent corroboration, and it relies heavily on Trump’s own narrative while providing minimal counterbalance beyond the brief denial statements.
